repository-code: "https://github.com/foxeswithdata/bhima_processing"
abstract: >-
  Analysis and figure code for a coupled GEB-PlantFATE study of afforestation
  in the Ghod subbasin, Maharashtra, India. Processes daily model output for
  twelve afforestation and biodiversity scenarios into catchment-scale
  aggregates, spatial diagnostics and publication figures. Model output is
  archived separately at doi:10.5281/zenodo.18457345.
keywords:
  - GEB
  - PlantFATE
  - afforestation
  - socio-hydrology
  - forest restoration
  - biodiversity
  - evapotranspiration
  - vegetation demography
  - Western Ghats
  - India
